      "id": 410512,
      "username": "NCP",
      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2024-05-22T07:26:51.392Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Something similar logic has to be set up.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"123236\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ncp/48/66573_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/how-to-remove-row-of-child-table-using-script/123236/4\">How to remove row of child table using script?</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/erpnext/6\"><span data-category-id=\"6\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #BF1E2E; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF;\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category \"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">ERPNext</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Please check it. \n <a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/8/2848d4dd3caa84edd7d53e3c4a68f3825b568cd6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/2848d4dd3caa84edd7d53e3c4a68f3825b568cd6\" title=\"image\">[image]</a> \n <a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/7/97a3ace955ff9c8af47e814f84a0b8b7ee95cbc9.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/97a3ace955ff9c8af47e814f84a0b8b7ee95cbc9\" title=\"image\">[image]</a> \nOutput: \n <a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/9/e943d5b4d81a83497f5b475fe28f217389fa1d60.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e943d5b4d81a83497f5b475fe28f217389fa1d60\" title=\"image\">[image]</a> \nI provided the sample, now you can set it according to the scenario.\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ncp/{size}/66573_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 10,
